{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":290,"mirrow":false,"y":-259,"img":"chara029_1","addImg":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1a"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":290,"mirrow":false,"y":-259,"img":"chara029_1","addImg":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]你问我为什么少言寡语？我确实不太喜欢和一部分人说话，但这并不是看不起他们，只是我不想进行不必要的沟通。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]你看，如果双方认知差距太大，沟通会很困难。[r]不但会平白无故消耗不少能量用在解释上，从结果上预计，这沟通也很难有什么成效。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1g"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]偶尔我也会好奇，你是怎么能耐得住性子，和那些荒野客交流的？[r]要是真有什么简单的技巧，也许我也能努把力了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]你说你只是正常聊天，可能是你脾气好……唉，这还真令人羡慕。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]不然，以后就请你做我的沟通助理，全职帮我进行交际沟通吧——[r]哈哈，开玩笑的啦。我会自己勤加练习的……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"安娜-友善3","script":"yd_029_03"}